{"title":"Goblin Mage","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Goblin Mage is a named <a href=\"#/monster/goblin\">Goblin</a> seen at level 8 (mage).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Goblin Mage</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Rustpick Mine</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-44\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"goblin-mage\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">79 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-small\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7e73cfe258f353082838.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Small</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-renew\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d65310365631cac7ee0b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Renew</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Goblins</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/goblin-miner\">Goblin Miner</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-brute\">Goblin Brute</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-shaman\">Goblin Shaman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-king\">Goblin King</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/nib-the-toolkeeper\">Nib the Toolkeeper</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ratch\">Ratch</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/ba717818308d4d0eeccf.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Goblin Mage</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/goblin\">Gobl